{"duration": 23.67, "cues": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 4.34, "text": "Scientists had already seen this on the\nother side of the world. On the second of"}, {"start": 4.34, "end": 10.24, "text": "November 2009, orcas passed Southeast\nFarallon Island near San Francisco. They"}, {"start": 10.24, "end": 14.86, "text": "stayed for about two and a half hours.\nSeventeen tagged great whites were feeding"}, {"start": 14.86, "end": 19.58, "text": "around the island that day. Within\neight hours, every one of them had gone."}, {"start": 20.28, "end": 23.67, "text": "Sixteen stayed away for\nthe rest of the season."}], "words": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.58, "text": "Scientists"}, {"start": 0.58, "end": 0.82, "text": "had"}, {"start": 0.82, "end": 1.08, "text": "already"}, {"start": 1.08, "end": 1.44, "text": "seen"}, {"start": 1.44, "end": 1.64, "text": "this"}, {"start": 1.64, "end": 1.82, "text": "on"}, {"start": 1.82, "end": 1.92, "text": "the"}, {"start": 1.92, "end": 2.1, "text": "other"}, {"start": 2.1, "end": 2.3, "text": "side"}, {"start": 2.3, "end": 2.46, "text": "of"}, {"start": 2.46, "end": 2.52, "text": "the"}, {"start": 2.52, "end": 2.86, "text": "world."}, {"start": 3.68, "end": 3.7, "text": "On"}, {"start": 3.7, "end": 3.82, "text": "the"}, {"start": 3.82, "end": 4.18, "text": "second"}, {"start": 4.18, "end": 4.34, "text": "of"}, {"start": 4.34, "end": 4.68, "text": "November"}, {"start": 4.68, "end": 5.64, "text": "2009,"}, {"start": 6.24, "end": 6.48, "text": "orcas"}, {"start": 6.48, "end": 6.82, "text": "passed"}, {"start": 6.82, "end": 7.3, "text": "Southeast"}, {"start": 7.3, "end": 7.94, "text": "Farallon"}, {"start": 7.94, "end": 8.22, "text": "Island"}, {"start": 8.22, "end": 8.48, "text": "near"}, {"start": 8.48, "end": 8.74, "text": "San"}, {"start": 8.74, "end": 9.24, "text": "Francisco."}, {"start": 10.12, "end": 10.24, "text": "They"}, {"start": 10.24, "end": 10.54, "text": "stayed"}, {"start": 10.54, "end": 10.76, "text": "for"}, {"start": 10.76, "e